  "id": "tasks/the-tasks-note-lists-the-latest-six-tasks-and-a-standalone-turn-none",
  "title": "The notes list the room's latest six tasks; a turn in a room with no task and a standalone instruction's turn carry no tasks' block",
  "rules": [
    "§23.4",
    "§10.1.1 rule 7"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.1.1-030"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/tasks/test_task_progress_note.py::test_only_the_latest_tasks_are_listed_and_none_means_no_note, test_a_room_without_tasks_and_a_standalone_turn_carry_no_tasks; channels/_tasks_note.py TASKS_NOTE_LIMIT, channels/_ai_context.py _tasks_notes (standalone).",
